WEBVTT

00:07:29.892 --> 00:07:32.862
So over the next couple of years,

00:07:32.862 --> 00:07:35.500
Pete — we've had our highs and our lows.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.938
Pete was put on a compassionate use drug.

00:07:37.938 --> 00:07:41.121
It was hope in a bottle for 
the whole ALS community.

00:07:41.121 --> 00:07:43.330
It was in a phase III trial.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:47.916
Then six months later, the 
data comes back: no efficacy.

00:07:47.917 --> 00:07:50.388
We were supposed to 
have therapies overseas,

00:07:50.388 --> 00:07:52.537
and the rug was 
pulled out from under us.

00:07:52.537 --> 00:07:54.482
So for the next two years,

00:07:54.482 --> 00:07:58.764
we just watched my son 
be taken away from me,

00:07:58.764 --> 00:08:02.435
little by little every day.